  ║                                                               ║
  ║  HOW TO USE:                                                  ║
  ║  1. In Theme Editor → Remove the default Announcement bar     ║
  ║  2. Add section → Custom Liquid (at the very top)             ║
  ║  3. Paste this entire code                                    ║
  ║  4. Save & publish                                            ║
